Vendored data licenses — arch/arm64/data
========================================

This directory vendors third-party data used by cmd/gen-sysregs to generate
arch/arm64/sysregs_generated.go. The generated Go table is a derivative work;
each source retains its own license terms below.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. ARM System Register XML  (./sysreg/AArch64-*.xml)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Source:    https://developer.arm.com/documentation/109390/latest/
           (Arm "System Register Data release for A-profile architecture")
Copyright: (c) Arm Limited (or its affiliates). All rights reserved.

Distributed under the terms agreed between Arm and the party to whom Arm
delivered this data (the click-through license accompanying the Arm Architecture
Reference Manual / System Register Data release). Each XML file retains its
original Arm copyright and license header verbatim.

THE DATA IS PROVIDED "AS IS". Arm gives no warranties in relation to the data
and, to the maximum extent permitted by law, excludes all liabilities for any
loss or damage arising from its use.

